01:01:29,044 --> 01:01:34,245
[SPEAKER_01]: That I have learned now, that I shouldn't act out of, but this justifies it.

656
01:01:35,586 --> 01:01:35,846
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

657
01:01:36,246 --> 01:01:43,348
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you still choose to put that which you should put first, you put it a second, and oh, okay, no, I'll... it justifies it, I'll deal with this.

658
01:01:43,548 --> 01:01:50,490
[SPEAKER_01]: And it's like, that's why, even if you get the right answer, quote-unquote, and write the right paper on concealings... You're making it worse, but...

