[SPEAKER_01]: Exactly.

660
01:01:51,790 --> 01:01:54,231
[SPEAKER_01]: Or, at least, you're certainly not not making it better.

661
01:01:54,964 --> 01:02:02,430
[SPEAKER_01]: You're not going to be any closer to uprooting conceivings, because you still very much, when the choice is presented, you choose to act out of pressure.

662
01:02:02,830 --> 01:02:05,212
[SPEAKER_01]: You choose to give in to it and follow it.

663
01:02:06,193 --> 01:02:06,493
[SPEAKER_00]: Right.

664
01:02:06,553 --> 01:02:19,724
[SPEAKER_00]: The mind is asking you to re-clarify it and get the answer and like, that whatever, that pleasure, it's sort of seeking from, you know, sort of contemplation and, oh, you know, that's the insight and etc.

665
01:02:21,726 --> 01:02:22,586
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, you're very right.

666
01:02:23,087 --> 01:02:23,347
[SPEAKER_00]: That's...

667
01:02:24,982 --> 01:02:25,602
[SPEAKER_00]: It's a good point.

668
01:02:29,485 --> 01:02:30,806
[SPEAKER_00]: It is a very blatant thing.

669
01:02:30,826 --> 01:02:32,967
[SPEAKER_00]: It's just like you sort of...

670
01:02:33,147 --> 01:02:35,169
[SPEAKER_00]: It's basically sensuality anyway, right?

671
01:02:35,249 --> 01:02:40,572
[SPEAKER_01]: It's just that... Well, fundamentally, yeah, the central being, the central domain, the extent of the craving determines that, yeah.

672
01:02:41,012 --> 01:02:49,238
[SPEAKER_01]: But also, see, you start understanding it like this and then it becomes a lot clearer how there were people in the suttas that were literally just told

